1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,000
[train rumbles]

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
[narrator] In the forests of the Dentora
region of the Republic of Padokea

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
lies a dormant volcano
measuring 3,722 meters high.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
It is known as Kukuroo Mountain.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
It is home to a family
of famous assassins, the Zoldyck family.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Visitors arrive every day,
in hopes of catching

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
a glimpse of the mansion
which has never been seen.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
It's one of this nation's
most popular tourist attractions.

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
[theme music plays]

10
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,000
[Zebro] Well, how long
will you be staying here?

11
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Until we see Killua!

12
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,000
And we're not leaving a second before!

13
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,000
[chuckles]

14
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,000
[Zebro] All right, then. Follow me.

15
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:16,000
THE X GUARD'S X DUTY

16
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
[narrator] Gon and his friends
have begun to confront

17
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:25,000
the obstacles that they must overcome
in order to reunite with Killua.

18
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:30,000
They head toward their destination
with no idea what awaits them.

19
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,000
[Zebro] Here we are.
These are the servants' quarters.

20
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:40,000
It's getting pretty late...
so, you can stay here tonight.

21
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:46,000
[rumbling]

22
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:49,000
-[Kurapika] Uh...
-[Zebro] Please, come on in.

23
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Hey, anybody home?

24
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,000
[man]
Guests, huh? Don't see that every day.

25
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:03,000
[Zebro] This is Seaquant.
He works with me here at the estate.

26
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,000
[Gon] Good evening.

27
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,000
Hmm.

28
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Zebro doesn't take a liking
to just anybody.

29
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,000
Make yourselves at home.

30
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:16,000
Though in this house,
that's easier said than done.

31
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:26,000
You wanna see young Master Killua?
[laughs] Now, that's pretty funny.

32
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,000
[Leorio] Actually, we're dead serious.

33
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:32,000
Then let me give you some advice.
Give up now and go home.

34
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,000
What did you say?

35
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,000
[Seaquant] Zebro told you
about the Testing Gate, right?

36
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:40,000
If you wanna know what this place is like,
that's an example.

37
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,000
[Gon] It won't be easy. We get that.

38
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,000
But still, I'm not leaving yet.

39
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Not until I see Killua!

40
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Before, when he was in trouble,

41
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,000
I wasn't there for him
like I should've been.

42
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:07,000
If I was... If I'd just been there...

43
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,000
I know I could have stopped him.

44
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:17,000
He's my friend,
and he's really important to me, okay?

45
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:24,000
[Zebro chuckles] I understand.

46
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:27,000
In that case, why don't you do
some training while you're here?

47
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:30,000
-What do you mean?
-Hey now, Zebro.

48
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,000
[Zebro] Listen to me, Gon.

49
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,000
You three can try to open
the door together.

50
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,000
There's nothing wrong with teamwork.

51
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:41,000
And with a little bit of training,
it should be possible.

52
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,000
How about it?

53
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,000
I don't like the idea of being tested.

54
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
But if there's truly no other way...

55
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,000
I guess we'll just have to do it!

56
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,000
Yeah!

57
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:59,000
All right. Then, I'm going to need
all three of you to put something on.

58
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,000
[Gon, Kurapika and Leorio] Huh?

59
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:04,000
[Leorio grunting]

60
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:08,000
[groans] How is this so heavy?

61
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:10,000
[Zebro] It weighs 50 kilograms.

62
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,000
Wear it at all times,
except when you're sleeping.

63
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,000
[Leorio groans]

64
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:17,000
I'll make it heavier
as you get used to it.

65
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,000
[Leorio yells]

66
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,000
[Zebro] Here, have some tea.

67
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:25,000
[Leorio grunting] What the--?

68
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,000
[all grunting]

69
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:30,000
The cups weigh 20 kilograms.
And this teapot weighs 40.

70
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,000
What?

71
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:34,000
[Zebro] All the furniture
and utensils in this house

72
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,000
weigh over 20 kilograms each.

73
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:39,000
[Kurapika] I see what you're getting at.
So, this will serve as training.

74
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:41,000
[Seaquant] What's the point?

75
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:44,000
You know they're just gonna give up
in two or three days.

76
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,000
What was that?

77
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:49,000
Oh, Seaquant, unless I'm mistaken,
your shift's already started, hasn't it?

78
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,000
Yeah, I think you're right.

79
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,000
[Leorio growls]

80
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:54,000
[door rumbling]

81
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:57,000
Sorry about that.
He really isn't such a bad person.

82
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:00,000
Oh, by the way, where's the bathroom?

83
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,000
Right through that door over there.

84
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:05,000
[Leorio panting]

85
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:08,000
Let me guess. The bathroom door is also...

86
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:11,000
Of course. That door weighs 500 kilograms.

87
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,000
Five-hundred?

88
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,000
What? You're kidding me!

89
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:19,000
I'm gonna spring a leak!

90
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:25,000
[footsteps approaching]

91
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:28,000
[water drips]

92
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,000
[Kikyo] Kalluto, dear, open the door.

93
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,000
[Kikyo]
Kil, have you learned your lesson yet?

94
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:07,000
[Milluki] It's no use, Mama.
He isn't even the least bit sorry.

95
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,000
-We need to make him suffer more.

96
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,000
[fan cracks]

97
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:14,000
-Enough! Shut your mouth, Milluki!
-[Milluki huffs]

98
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:19,000
[Kikyo] Kil, darling, why don't you stop
being so stubborn

99
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:21,000
and just say that you're sorry?

100
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:26,000
Oh, and about that friend of yours.
His name is Gon, isn't it?

101
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,000
He'd be better off leaving,

102
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:32,000
but it sounds like he wants
to try his hand at the Testing Gate.

103
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Gon, he's... he's here?

104
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:40,000
Milluki! You said far too much.
Now, you see, Kil--

105
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:44,000
-Why the hell didn't you tell me?
-[whip cracks]

106
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,000
Don't you ever talk to Mom
like that again!

107
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,000
I told you to shut your mouth!

108
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:52,000
I didn't think telling you was necessary.

109
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:55,000
He can't open the gate,
not in a million years.

110
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:57,000
-[Killua] He will.
-[gasps]

111
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:00,000
He'll do it. I know it.

112
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,000
Well, isn't that absolutely divine?

113
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:08,000
However, he won't make it here.
I can promise you that.

114
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,000
[Killua] Gon will.

115
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:12,000
He can do it. He'll prove you wrong.

116
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:17,000
No question.
He'll definitely make it here.

117
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,000
[Leorio] Gon, wait.

118
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,000
You just watch, okay?

119
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,000
But why?

120
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,000
You need to let your arm
heal properly, first.

121
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:41,000
If Kurapika and I can open it ourselves,
you don't have to worry.

122
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,000
Let us handle it.

123
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,000
Fine.

124
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:48,000
-You ready, Kurapika?
-Yeah!

125
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:51,000
[both grunting]

126
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:57,000
[Seaquant] Come on, you're only
wasting your time.

127
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,000
[Kurapika] No use. It won't budge.

128
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,000
[Leorio] Damn it!

129
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,000
But we only just started training.

130
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,000
If we work hard enough,
I know we can do it!

131
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,000
[Kurapika]
I wish I could share your optimism.

132
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,000
[chuckles]

133
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:39,000
[both grunting]

134
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:48,000
[snoring]

135
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:54,000
[grunting]

136
00:09:56,000 --> 00:10:03,000
[both grunting]

137
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:06,000
[both panting]

138
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,000
I'm telling you,
this is never gonna work.

139
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:10,000
You're just kidding yourselves,
you know that.

140
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:14,000
Well, if you're so sure,
quit watching and go do your job.

141
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,000
[Kurapika] Gon is one of us.

142
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:23,000
[sighs] And he's made it clear
that he wishes to see his friend.

143
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,000
Quite clear.

144
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:28,000
It's only right to help him
achieve his goal.

145
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,000
[Leorio] Let's give it another shot!

146
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,000
[Kurapika] Yeah!

147
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:39,000
[both grunting]

148
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:47,000
[Seaquant] Oh, give me a break.
You can't keep pushing mindlessly.

149
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,000
Get your timing in sync.

150
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:54,000
You have to push both doors
simultaneously with everything you've got.

151
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:57,000
Otherwise, it'll never open.

152
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,000
[Zebro chuckles]

153
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:03,000
[Leorio] Get our timing in sync.

154
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:07,000
[Kurapika] Push both doors simultaneously,
and with all our might.

155
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,000
You ready?

156
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,000
One!

157
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,000
And two!

158
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,000
[both] Three!

159
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:16,000
[both grunting]

160
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,000
[all gasp]

161
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,000
[Gon] Leorio! Kurapika!

162
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,000
It moved a little.

163
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:47,000
HUNTER GLOSSARY

164
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:51,000
TESTING GATE

165
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,000
[man] What's that?

166
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:01,000
The Testing Gate? Are you certain?

167
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,000
And?

168
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:09,000
[Seaquant] Oh, well, I just wanted
to let you know, is all.

169
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,000
Very well.

170
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:16,000
Why does he always have to be
so damn gruff?

171
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,000
[Leorio grunting]

172
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:39,000
Hey, you two. Look, why don't you try
taking those vests off, today?

173
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:42,000
Huh? Well, don't mind if I do.

174
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:48,000
All right, now we'll be able
to open the gate for sure!

175
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,000
-Let's do this, Kurapika!
-Right!

176
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,000
One, and two...

177
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,000
[both] Three!

178
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:04,000
[both grunting]

179
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,000
[gasps]

180
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:24,000
[Leorio] Damn it.
That's as far as it'll go!

181
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:29,000
You can't give up yet.
Keep pushing!

182
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,000
Okay, I'm with you!

183
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,000
Gon!

184
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:37,000
What do you think you're doing?
Your arm, remember?

185
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:39,000
It's okay. It's healed now.

186
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,000
[Kurapika] What, already?

187
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:44,000
-[Leorio] Are you sure, Gon?
-[Gon] Yep!

188
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:47,000
So anyway, we gotta match our breathing?

189
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:50,000
-Uh, that's right.
-Well, let's push.

190
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,000
Here goes!

191
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,000
Ready!

192
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,000
Get set!

193
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,000
Go!

194
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:58,000
[all grunting]

195
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:07,000
-It's opening.
-[Zebro chuckles]

196
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:10,000
[gasps]

197
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,000
[Gon grunts]

198
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:13,000
[Gon] Ow!

199
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:18,000
[both panting]

200
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,000
It opened.

201
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,000
[Leorio] Hell yeah!

202
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:26,000
-[Kurapika] We really did it, Gon!
-[Gon] Uh-huh!

203
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:34,000
[Zebro] Now then, just follow this path
and head toward the mountain.

204
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:36,000
The mansion should be up there somewhere.

205
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:41,000
Never been there myself,
which is kind of embarrassing,

206
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:46,000
considering I've worked here for 20 years.
I'm sorry I can't be of any more help.

207
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:48,000
No, sir, you have been.

208
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:51,000
Mr. Zebro, Seaquant,
thanks for everything.

209
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,000
[chuckles]

210
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:55,000
[Gon] Thanks again!

211
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,000
See you later!

212
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,000
[Zebro] They're really something.

213
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:09,000
Those three might actually have
what it takes to reach the mansion.

214
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:13,000
[snickers] It's not gonna happen.
They'll die for sure.

215
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:16,000
Are you speaking from your experience
back then?

216
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:20,000
-[wind rustles]
-[birds squawk]

217
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:29,000
[Seaquant] A single apprentice butler
wiped us out to the last man.

218
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:32,000
And that made one thing
painfully clear:

219
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:35,000
that I'd gotten myself in
way over my head.

220
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:39,000
I recall you were so impressed
that you asked for a job here.

221
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,000
Yeah, well, excuse me.

222
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:49,000
But the bosses and workers here
are monsters. Every last one.

223
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:51,000
And once you step onto their turf...

224
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,000
[Kikyo] The Testing Gate opened?

225
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,000
[butler] Yes, ma'am.

226
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:59,000
[Kikyo]
This is a critical time for Killua.

227
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:03,000
We simply cannot allow anyone near him!

228
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:06,000
Especially unnecessary distractions
like friends.

229
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:09,000
-Is that clear?
-[butler] Yes, ma'am.

230
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:28,000
Please leave now.
You're trespassing on private property.

231
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:31,000
I can't allow you to pass
without permission.

232
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:35,000
[Gon] But we called ahead,
and we came in through the Testing Gate.

233
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:38,000
[Canary] The butler's quarters did not
give you permission to enter.

234
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:41,000
What the heck do we need to do
to get permission?

235
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:44,000
I even told them I was Killua's friend
and everything.

236
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:47,000
Who knows?
No one has ever received permission.

237
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:50,000
[Gon] Then I guess we're gonna
have to trespass!

238
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,000
I suppose so.

239
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:56,000
In any case,
this is where I draw the line.

240
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:02,000
Take one step past it and I will remove
you by force if necessary.

241
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,000
Damn it!

242
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:24,000
[Gon] Leorio! Kurapika!

243
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:28,000
Stay where you are.
I'll handle this.

244
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Ow!

245
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:34,000
Look, we didn't come here
to fight anyone.

246
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:36,000
We just want to see Killua.

247
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:39,000
Your motives don't matter.

248
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:44,000
I have my orders, and it is my duty
to follow them.

249
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:05,000
Try all you like.

250
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:13,000
I'll never let you pass.

251
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:17,000
[Gon] I will pass.

252
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:19,000
I'm gonna see Killua!

253
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:31,000
[Canary] Welcome home, Master Killua.

254
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,000
[Killua] Yeah.

255
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:41,000
-I made one.
-Huh?

256
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:45,000
[Killua] A friend.

257
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:10,000
[staff thudding]

258
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:35,000
Stop right there.

259
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:38,000
Please go away!

260
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:48,000
Why won't you just give up?
You know it's pointless!

261
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:51,000
Please stop him! You're his friends!
Why...?

262
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:00,000
[Gon] What's the big deal?

263
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:02,000
I just came here to see my friend.

264
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:05,000
The only reason I'm here
is to see Killua!

265
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:06,000
[gasps]

266
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:10,000
[Gon] So why are you making me
go through all of this?

267
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:14,000
[birds cawing]

268
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:21,000
-[Gon] Hey.
-[Canary gasps]

269
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:25,000
[Gon] I crossed the line.
Shouldn't you hit me?

270
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:29,000
I can tell you're different from Mike.

271
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:32,000
You may be trying to cover up
your feelings,

272
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:34,000
but you still have a heart.

273
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:39,000
When I mentioned Killua's name,
your eyes softened, just for a moment.

274
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:49,000
[Canary sniffling] Please...

275
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:54,000
Help him. Help Master--

276
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:56,000
[glass crackles]

277
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:01,000
[all gasping]

278
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:03,000
[Kikyo] Honestly...

279
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:05,000
What was that servant babbling about?

280
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:09,000
She made it sound
like we were being mean to Killua.

281
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:15,000
How rude. She's just a bloody apprentice.

282
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:20,000
And you must be Gon.
Illumi told me all about you.

283
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:24,000
Killua is aware that you've been
on the premises for some time now.

284
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:29,000
I have a message from Killua
that he asked me to relay to you.

285
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:34,000
"Thank you for coming.
I'm happy that you did.

286
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:39,000
But I can't see you right now.
I'm sorry."

287
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:47,000
[narrator] Gon and his friends have
finally made it inside the Zoldyck estate.

288
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:50,000
But now, they face
their greatest obstacle yet:

289
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:56,000
a sad message from Killua himself,
saying that he cannot see them.

290
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:02,000
[theme music plays]

291
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:26,000
[Gon] Next time.
"The Zoldyck Family."

292
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:28,000
[Gon] Who is Killua to you, anyway?

293
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:30,000
[Kalluto] My big brother!
